## Description

This detection identifies **successful Windows logon events** by monitoring **Windows Security Event ID 4624**.

Successful authentication events provide valuable visibility into user activity and are essential for detecting unauthorized access, suspicious logon patterns, lateral movement, and compromised accounts.

Monitoring Event ID 4624 enables analysts to establish user baselines and identify unusual authentication behavior across the environment.

